				Theoc.
				18.7
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυγμαὶ δ᾽ ἦσαν
			ἐγκροτούμεναι</span> the fists were <i>dashing one against the
